ough attacks and obstacles by dashing), Breaking the Fourth Wall (Is aware of the narrator and comments on his narration), Non-Physical Interaction (Able to interact even with ghost-like shades and kill them with his attacks. Able to kill Exalted warriors in their soul form which allows them to endlessly regenerate their bodies. Able to kill Soul Catchers), Void Manipulation and Acausality (Type 4; Can access and exist within Chaos, an infinite void of nothingness. Can destroy Voidstones which are crystalized from the void and can spread their nature of utter nothingness to the environment. Is able to catch Voidskates which exists within nothingness with an alien malleable shape beyond a normal person's view. Has connection to Chaos through his relationship with Nyx), Summoning and Blessed (Beloved by the gods of Olympus and is able to acquire boons from them and call upon their aid. Carries dolls that allows him to teleport various companions he has a strong relationship with to fight with him, which is stated to be related to his powers as a god), Supernatural Luck (Able to increase his chance of finding coins and superior loot), Fate Manipulation (Able to alter fate in order to change a future reward, or to change the riches offered in the Well of Charon or the boons offered by gods. Shocked Nyx by fulfilling all prophecies in his Fated List which she thought was impossible, with Nyx stating that Zagreus ca"
